    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about needing time to \"reconnect\" though. it's more like... compared to how big everything is, i just don't matter. if i just stopped, if i just wasn't here anymore, there wouldn't be a ripple. no one would even notice the gap. it's almost comforting how little i actually weigh on the world.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
